    "body": "Hi, I got a statistics.\r\nThe Chrome [UMA](https://chromestatus.com/metrics/feature/timeline/popularity/4167) shows usage is 0.00020% and Blink API owner, or @yoavweiss said  \"the low usage suggests that the intent may not get a lot of pushback, assuming other browsers are planned to follow.\"\r\n\r\nSo I'd say the change looks safe in terms of compatibility risk.\r\n",
