    "updated_at": "2024-11-16T01:13:57Z",
    "body": "Is there any movement on this, or ways that I as a non-browser developer can help move this along? Some environments do not have a native EventSource implementation, and polyfilling these with a fetch implementation currently triggers CORS preflights when a last event ID is sent, which not all servers have safelisted.\r\n",
